--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SYNTHETIC EXECUTION NOTES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This output is a credible fixture for parser and visualization development.
It is not the result of a real BISON run and should not be used as evidence of
code correctness, validation, reactor performance, or fuel qualification.

Expected first real-run edits against a specific BISON/MOOSE version may include:
  - replacing ConvectiveFluxFunction with the installed-version equivalent,
  - confirming TensorMechanics action syntax,
  - replacing surrogate material models with BISON-supported material objects,
  - replacing GeneratedMesh with a QA-reviewed Exodus mesh,
  - separating app-only AuxVariables from validated fuel-performance quantities.

